This file exists solely so the wwwroot/uploads/resumes directory is present
when the API host starts. ASP.NET Core's static-file provider is bound to
whatever wwwroot looks like at startup - if the folder doesn't exist yet,
files created into it later (e.g. by the resume-upload endpoint) are saved
correctly but 404 when fetched, because the file provider never notices the
directory. Keeping this placeholder guarantees the folder always exists.
